WEBVTT

00:04:26.626 --> 00:04:30.800
without disconnecting
ourselves from our world.

00:04:30.824 --> 00:04:35.146
Today, we started by talking
about the boundary,

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.826
but if we remove this boundary,

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:41.714
the only boundary left is our imagination.

00:04:41.738 --> 00:04:42.962
Thank you.

00:04:42.986 --> 00:04:48.071
(Applause)